  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Aw, baby, how you doin'?",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You know I'm gonna cut right to the chase, huh?",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Some women were made, but me, myself?",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I like to think that I was created for a special purpose",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And, uh, what's more special than you?",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You feel me?",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It's on, baby, let's get lost",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You don't need to call in to work 'cause you're the boss",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "For real, want you to show me how you feel",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I consider myself lucky, that's a big deal",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Why? Well, you got the key to my heart",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But you ain't gonna need it, I'd rather you open up my body",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And show me secrets you didn't know was inside",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "No need for me to lie",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It's too big (Big), it's too wide (Wide)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It's too strong (Strong), it won't fit (Fit)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "It's too much (Much), it's too tough (Tough)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He talk like this 'cause he can back it up",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "He got a big ego (Ego)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Such a huge ego",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I love his big ego, it's too much",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "He walk like this 'cause he can back it up (Haha)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Usually I'm humble, right now, I don't choose",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You can leave with me or you could have the blues",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Some call it arrogant, I call it confident",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You decide when you find out what I'm working with",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Damn, I know, I'm killing you with them legs",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Better yet, them thighs, matter of fact, it's my smile",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Or maybe my eyes? Boy, you a sight to see",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Kinda somethin' like me (Like me)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
